label Greeting
if {Transaction_VisitVar} <= 50:
	ManangAna: Jusko, anak. I feel like I'm cleaning up after eight people instead of four.
	ManangAna: One is making a mess in the kitchen while the other is tracking mud in the living room... Susmaryosep. [pause=0.4] I just need to lean on this counter and pretend I'm on vacation for five minutes.
else:
	ManangAna: Have you ever tried scrubbing bat wings, anak? Hehe! 
	ManangAna: I'm just joking... sort of. [pause=0.6] Everything is just so heavy tonight. [pause=0.4] But seeing the store open... it’s a nice sight. Stay safe here, ha?
[signal arg="dismiss"]
[end_timeline]

